physical-ai-ui

Physical AI camera, hand-tracking, and robot-control UI.

Options:
  --show-video-flip       Show the Flip Video control
  --camera-access=auto    Prefer read/write camera access, falling back to read-only
  --camera-access=ro      Force read-only camera access
  --camera-unit=<n>       Use Sensor Framework camera unit n; if omitted, use the first camera found
  -h, --help              Show command-line help

Hotkeys:
  h     Show or hide hotkey help
  q     Show or hide the GitHub QR code
  c     Show or hide Control Studio
  d     Toggle debug information
  e/k   Enable or disable robot control
  1-4   Move debug information
  p     Show or hide joint/IK popups
  r     Toggle ROI visibility
  s     Toggle skeleton visibility
  j     Toggle joint visibility
  l     Toggle low-confidence filtering
  [/]   Decrease/increase confidence threshold
  f     Toggle fullscreen
  ESC   Quit

Example:
  ./physical-ai-ui --camera-unit=3
